      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.88 (up from ₹0.69 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹308.5m (up 43% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹4.64m (up 29% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.5% (down from 1.7% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 44% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 17% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
